,{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":3355,"end_column":8,"end_line":102,"start_byte":3125,"start_column":5,"start_line":98},"text":"The keymap-name validator of the save dialog: Some(\"Cannot use the name of\nan existing keymap plug-in\") when name equals a builtin keymap name, Some(\n\"Cannot be empty\") when name is blank, else Nothing."},"generics":[],"kind":"function","name":"real.harlequin.tools.keymap_name_problem","public":true,"source_order":5,"span":{"end_byte":3373,"end_column":1,"end_line":106,"start_byte":3045,"start_column":1,"start_line":97},"callable_kind":"sync","parameters":[{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"name","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":3077,"end_column":33,"end_line":97,"start_byte":3068,"start_column":24,"start_line":97},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"}},{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"builtin_names","source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":3103,"end_column":59,"end_line":97,"start_byte":3079,"start_column":35,"start_line":97},"type":{"item":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"},"kind":"list"}}],"return_type":{"item":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"},"kind":"option"},"contract":{"clauses":[],"effects":[]},"body":null},{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":5366,"end_column":8,"end_line":139,"start_byte":3507,"start_column":5,"start_line":112},"text":"The `harlequin --keys` editor as one full-screen lock-selected\nprompt_toolkit Application built without classes. The screen shows the\ninstruction \"The table below shows the active key bindings loaded from your\nconfig. Edit the key bindings, then quit to save them to a keymap.\" and\n\"Loaded Keymaps: {', '.join(active)}\", then the table of\nkeymap_rows(available, active) with columns \"Action\", \"Keys\" (keys joined\nwith \", \", each shown through real.harlequin.keymap.key_label) and \"Key\nDisplay\", one row highlighted (up/down/pageup/pagedown/home/end move).\nenter opens the binding editor for the row: \"Use the buttons below to\nreplace, remove, or add bindings for this action.\" and \"Enter: Select\nButton; Tab: Next Button\", one \"Edit\" and \"Remove\" button per key, an \"Add\nKey\" button, a \"Key Display\" input, and \"Submit\"/\"Cancel\". Edit and Add Key\nshow \"Press a key combination\" and capture the next key press as its\nTextual key name (ctrl+x, shift+tab, f5, a, ...). Submit applies\nedit_row_keys; Cancel keeps the row.\nctrl+q quits: without changes the app returns 0 at once; with changes a\nquit dialog offers \"Keep Editing\", \"Discard + Quit\" and \"Save + Quit\" with\ninputs for the keymap name (initially the last active name) and the file\npath (initially save_path; must not be a directory). Save validates the\nname with keymap_name_problem, writes rows_to_keymap(name, rows) with\nreal.harlequin.config.write_keymap(path, keymap), and after the screen is\nrestored prints \"Keymap {name} written to file at {path}\" then \"Use it\nwith: harlequin --keymap-name {name}\" or in a profile\n\"keymap_name=['{name}']\" under the title \"Keymap successfully created\";\na ConfigError prints its title and message to stderr and returns 2.\nReturns 0 otherwise."},"generics":[],"kind":"function","name":"real.harlequin.tools.run_keys_app","public":true,"source_order":6,"span":{"end_byte":5410,"end_column":1,"end_line":143,"start_byte":3373,"start_column":1,"start_line":106},"callable_kind":"sync","parameters":[{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"save_path","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":3409,"end_column":20,"end_line":107,"start_byte":3394,"start_column":5,"start_line":107},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"path"}},{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"active","source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":3432,"end_column":22,"end_line":108,"start_byte":3415,"start_column":5,"start_line":108},"type":{"item":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"},"kind":"list"}},{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"builtin_names","source_order":2,"span":{"end_byte":3462,"end_column":29,"end_line":109,"start_byte":3438,"start_column":5,"start_line":109},"type":{"item":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"},"kind":"list"}},{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"available","source_order":3,"span":{"end_byte":3491,"end_column":28,"end_line":110,"start_byte":3468,"start_column":5,"start_line":110},"type":{"item":{"args":[],"kind":"named","name":"real.harlequin.keymap.KeyMap"},"kind":"list"}}],"return_type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"i64"},"contract":{"clauses":[],"effects":[{"key":"file.read","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":5390,"end_column":23,"end_line":141,"start_byte":5381,"start_column":14,"start_line":141}},{"key":"file.write","source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":5402,"end_column":35,"end_line":141,"start_byte":5392,"start_column":25,"start_line":141}},{"key":"tty","source_order":2,"span":{"end_byte":5407,"end_column":40,"end_line":141,"start_byte":5404,"start_column":37,"start_line":141}}]},"body":null},{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":6614,"end_column":8,"end_line":160,"start_byte":5510,"start_column":5,"start_line":144},"text":"The profile the config wizard writes (upstream _prompt_to_create_profile):\nnamed answers.profile_name, entries in this order: adapter (Text),\nconn_str (Array of Text from shlex.split, only when nonblank), read_only\n(Boolean true, only when true), theme (Text), viewer_max_rows (Integer,\nonly when blank-stripped text is a whole number >= 0; blank or invalid\nanswers omit it so profile resolution retains its 100000-row default),\nkeymap_name (Array of Text), limit (Integer, only when blank-stripped text\nis an integer >= 0), show_files, show_s3,\nlocale (Text, only when nonblank), then when use_ssh: ssh_host (stripped\nText), ssh_forward (Array of Text from shlex.split, only when nonblank),\nssh_batch_mode (Boolean true, only when true), ssh_timeout (Real, only when\nnonblank), then each adapter option answer in adapter_option_list order\nunder its profile key (name with \"-\" replaced by \"_\"): Text answers only\nwhen nonblank, Flag answers always (false included) as Boolean, Values\nanswers as Array of Text only when nonempty."},"generics":[],"kind":"function","name":"real.harlequin.tools.wizard_profile","public":true,"source_order":7,"span":{"end_byte":6717,"end_column":1,"end_line":167,"start_byte":5410,"start_column":1,"start_line":143},"callable_kind":"sync","parameters":[{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"answers","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":5450,"end_column":41,"end_line":143,"start_byte":5428,"start_column":19,"start_line":143},"type":{"args":[],"kind":"named","name":"real.harlequin.tools.WizardAnswers"}},{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"adapter_option_list","source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":5492,"end_column":83,"end_line":143,"start_byte":5452,"start_column":43,"start_line":143},"type":{"item":{"args":[],"kind":"named","name":"real.harlequin.adapters.AdapterOption"},"kind":"list"}}],"return_type":{"args":[],"kind":"named","name":"real.harlequin.config.Profile"},"contract":{"clauses":[{"clause_id":1,"kind":"ensures","expression":{"kind":"comparison_chain","operands":[{"kind":"field","base":{"kind":"result_ref","reference":{"kind":"parameter","symbol":"real.harlequin.tools.result"},"span":{"end_byte":6639,"end_column":24,"end_line":162,"start_byte":6628,"start_column":13,"start_line":162},"type":{"args":[],"kind":"named","name":"real.harlequin.config.Profile"}},"name":"name","reference":null,"span":{"end_byte":6639,"end_column":24,"end_line":162,"start_byte":6628,"start_column":13,"start_line":162},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"str"}},{"kind":"field","base":{"kind":"parameter_ref","symbol":"real.harlequin.tools.answers","reference":{"kind":"parameter","symbol":"real.harlequin.tools.answers"},"span":{"end_byte":6663,"end_column":48,"end_line":162,"start_byte":6643,"start_column":28,"start_line":162},"type":{"args":[],"kind":"named","name":"real.harlequin.tools.WizardAnswers"}},"name":"profile_name","reference":null,"span":{"end_byte":6663,"end